title: 'pallet-bridge-parachains: preserve re-imported parachain heads'
doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      Preserve a parachain head when ring-buffer pruning targets the same hash
      that is being re-imported. This prevents the best-head pointer from
      referencing missing head data after a repeated head wraps the buffer.
      No storage migration is required.
crates:
  - name: pallet-bridge-parachains
    bump: patch
